#
# Conformance case: common-logic/negation.
#
# ISO 24707 (Common Logic) example — a strongly negated ground predication:
#   CLIF:  (not (Married John))
# "John is not married." Encoded as the canonical logic: full-FOL Formula AST (a strong
# Not over a unary atom — distinct from negation-as-failure). Gates the CLIF/CGIF/XCL
# Exact projections: IR round-trip isomorphism + cross-dialect equivalence.

